    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we context, we have experience with public procurement in several EU jurisdictions, including France, where the city's is located. we standard contractual clauses include a data protection agreement template (DPA) that complies with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), which would be essential for this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential legal risks associated with this project include non-compliance with regulatory requirements, particularly the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and other applicable laws in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another risk is the possibility of disputes arising from The contract, such as disagreements over the scope of work, payment terms, or termination conditions. we has a no-copyleft GPL contamination policy, which might be relevant if the city's requires the use of specific open-source software. we also have professional indemnity insurance covering up to 5 million euros, cyber liability insurance covering up to 2 million euros, and a performance bond capacity of up to 1.5 million euros, which would help mitigate potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize potential risks, it is crucial to conduct thorough due diligence, carefully review the contract terms, and ensure that all parties understand all parties obligations and responsibilities throughout the project duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with the city's requirements, key contractual terms that should be included are a price revision mechanism, such as annual indexation capped at an official national index, with a maximum percentage increase per year. a price revision mechanism, such as annual indexation capped at an official national index, with a maximum percentage increase per year will help manage the annual cost of exploitation and keep the annual cost of exploitation compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another essential term is a limitation of liability clause, which would cap our liability to a specific amount, for instance, 3 million euros, to mitigate potential financial risks associated with the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the contract should include provisions for termination, such as notice periods and conditions for termination for cause or convenience. include would provide clarity on the circumstances under which the contract can be terminated and the obligations of both parties in such events." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our context, our have experience with public procurement in several EU jurisdictions, including France, where the city's is located. our standard contractual clauses include a data protection agreement template (DPA) that complies with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), which would be essential for the project." ;
